      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s what we did before via the console_is_restricted() check; this just uses the new capabilities check instead.\n\n(Might be able to use enabled_device?  Not 100% sure.  And really, this, I2C, and UART should all get refactored to have more similar APIs which support multiple ports cleanly/securely.  We can address this then.)",
